WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:14.851
Baa! Baa!

2
00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:18.304
The Royal Bedroom was full of sheep!

3
00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:21.419
"Sheep!" the queen yelled.

4
00:00:21.419 --> 00:00:24.478
She jumped into the king's arms.

5
00:00:24.478 --> 00:00:26.404
Tom stared at the sheep.

6
00:00:26.404 --> 00:00:28.781
"Oops!" he said.

7
00:00:28.781 --> 00:00:30.639
Dirk grinned.

8
00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:37.317
"Now Tom will go to the Grim Dungeon!" he thought.

9
00:00:37.317 --> 00:00:42.431
"What's going on?" the king roared.

10
00:00:42.432 --> 00:00:44.705
He walked among the sheep.

11
00:00:44.705 --> 00:00:46.688
Dirk followed the king.

12
00:00:46.688 --> 00:00:50.074
Then the king turned—and stepped on Dirk's foot.

13
00:00:50.075 --> 00:00:55.961
"Ouch!" Dirk hopped behind the king.

14
00:00:55.961 --> 00:00:59.385
"Your Majesty, I told Tom to make a drink!

15
00:00:59.385 --> 00:01:01.781
I didn't say sheep!"

16
00:01:01.781 --> 00:01:04.210
"Hrmpf!" the king said.

17
00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:08.522
"There are so many sheep!" the queen cried.

18
00:01:08.523 --> 00:01:18.020
The king began counting them. "One, two . . ."

19
00:01:18.021 --> 00:01:22.027
His eyelids felt heavy and he yawned.

20
00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:30.903
Suddenly the king fell—into Tom's arms!

21
00:01:30.903 --> 00:01:35.981
The king slept until the next morning.

22
00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:51.809
Tom and Cat brought the sheep outside.

23
00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:55.478
The sheep stayed under the king's window.

24
00:01:55.478 --> 00:02:06.299
Every night the king fell asleep—counting sheep!

25
00:02:06.299 --> 00:02:10.915
"I fall asleep before I count to ten," the king said.

26
00:02:10.915 --> 00:02:15.232
"Thank you, Tom!"

27
00:02:15.232 --> 00:02:19.457
Dirk was stuck taking care of the sheep.

28
00:02:19.457 --> 00:02:26.801
"I'll get that wizard!" he grumbled.

29
00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:29.641
The king was happy.

30
00:02:29.641 --> 00:02:32.066
But the queen was not.

31
00:02:32.066 --> 00:02:36.421
She still couldn't get any beauty sleep.

32
00:02:36.421 --> 00:02:43.454
The king's snoring kept her awake!
